<p>Overselling is, I think, one of my biggest faults as a writer in general: both with regards to description and characterisation I have no proper brakes, which some people enjoy and most don't. Thanks for the criticism on this front, because I need to hone in on what's effective and what flies overhead as redundant fluff &#8212; I should be able to do a second pass of editing some time this week, and I'll keep this in mind when I'm working on the third chapter.</p>
